sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Two-phase commit call sequence
    accDescr: The coordinator asks both shards to prepare and waits for their votes. If both vote yes, it sends commit and waits for acknowledgements. If either votes no, it sends abort to both shards.
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant A as Shard A
    participant B as Shard B

    C->>A: Prepare
    C->>B: Prepare
    A-->>C: Yes, ready
    B-->>C: Yes, ready
    alt All participants vote yes
        rect rgb(231, 244, 233)
        Note over C,B: Both participants voted yes and are prepared
        C->>A: COMMIT
        C->>B: COMMIT
        A-->>C: Committed
        B-->>C: Committed
        end
    else Any participant votes no
        rect rgb(251, 233, 233)
        Note over C,B: At least one participant votes no
        C->>A: ABORT
        C->>B: ABORT
        A-->>C: Aborted
        B-->>C: Aborted
        end
    end
